  "detail_text": "The amendment 0001 is issued. Date Offers Due (Solicitation closing date) has been extended. ******************************************************************************************************************* Solicitation N6264926QB001 has been officially issued to acquire commercial Bunkering/De-bunkering Transportation Services. Prospective offerors are advised that any future updates or modifications to the Performance Work Statement (PWS) and clauses will be released via an official amendment to this solicitation. ******************************************************************************************************************** Please be advised that this is a draft solicitation currently undergoing internal review. The final solicitation is scheduled to be issued on or before 20 February 2026. This solicitation is intended only for sources duly authorized to operate and do business in Japan, as prescribed by DFARS 252.225-7042. Prime Contractors outside of Japan must submit documentation that unambiguously demonstrates the Offer's compliance with DFARS 252.225-7042 (e.g. proof of incorporation) as part of their offer. As with all FAR and DFARS requirements, please ensure you are familiar with those requirements prior to submitting your quote. _______________________________________________________________ Bunkering/De-Bunkering Service at Tokyo Bay area in Japan for Commander Fleet Activities Yokosuka Naval Base. See attached Solicitation attachments for the detail",
